        <activityName xml:lang="en">Floor heating tube</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Floor heating tube
Production of floor heating pipes 16x2mm including fastening with clamping rails;
UUID: bf37ffe3-1e0d-3275-991b-a9d64ac5c21a
Materials used for the production. Energy use for the different production steps. Transport of raw materials to the plant.
Location: Data sources mainly from Switzerland. Process applicable in central European conditions.
Technology: Typical technology, materials and components used for pipe installations of heating systems in appartment and commercial buildings
Time period: Amount of material investigated in 2013.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Manufacturer informations and literature data. Data of typical products used. 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_bf37ffe3-1e0d-3275-991b-a9d64ac5c21a.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
